## 第 57 页

5.3 管理事务实例

Connection conn= dataSource.getConnection();
conn.setAutoCommit(false);
try{
   Statement stmt = conn.createStatement();
   stmt.executeUpdate("Insert into FriendMessage
                           (fromNo,toNo,message)
                           values(1,2,'How are you?')");
   stmt.executeUpdate("Update MyFriend set messagecount=
                           messagecount+1 where id=1");
   conn.commit();
}
catch(Exception e){
   conn.rollback();
}

